      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-28T17:01:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, yeah.\n\nMy stance will always firmly be: \"if the bytes have to match exactly, use `bstr .cbor`\". Relying on canonicalization leads only to pain.",
      "parentUuid": "e5c321ac_ca578bf0",
      "range": {
